        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-41, Ornate Mount Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy way to add a little decorative pizzazz to your kitchen cabinets, the Fancy Cabinet Pull comes with the installation hardware. It is available in 6 fashionable finishes--some traditional to really bring out the ornateness of this cabinet door pull, and some more modern to push this 3 inch cabinet pull into a contemporary realm. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-41 3\" Ornate Foot Bow Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nickel-dragonfly.jpg?v=1704354568\" width=\"514\" height=\"126\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
